## 1.5 Carat Emerald Cut Diamond Ring Price

A natural 1.5ct emerald cut diamond ring starts at $11,099 when built from the cheapest GIA-certified stone and the least expensive setting. Three natural stones sit in this size range in current certified market inventory — and the spread between them shows you exactly where the money goes.

The price gap across these three stones is $8,649. That gap buys a color improvement (E to D) that is not visible in a ring setting under any normal lighting condition. The E-VS1 at [$10,409](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29298663?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the correct pick without question.

