## Lab-Grown 1.5ct Emerald Cut Diamond Ring

Lab-grown emerald cuts in the near-2ct range start at [$2,229 for an IGI 1.94ct F-VVS1](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29147824?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). Add a [$1,115 Petite Four-Prong setting](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-four-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-18k-white-gold-item-194979?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) and the complete ring is $3,344 — less than one-third the cost of the natural 1.5ct ring.

At 2ct in lab, the stone measures approximately 9.0mm × 7.0mm. That is 1.0mm longer and 1.0mm wider than the natural 1.5ct. D-FL grade (the best grade available) in lab costs [$4,735](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28828463?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — less than the natural 1.5ct stone at E-VS1. Better grade, bigger stone, lower price.

