      <td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29587315?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">IGI D-VVS1</a></td>
      <td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29587315?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$7,737</a></td>
      <td><strong>$8,852</strong></td>
