The natural 2.5ct ring at $32,681 is 183% more than the natural 1.5ct ring at $11,524 — for a stone that is 23% longer. The lab 3ct ring at $10,350 is a larger stone for $1,174 less. At 2.5ct natural, the lab path is impossible to argue against on financial grounds.

